# trip PDFs: not committed; restore with `npm run sync:trip-pdfs`
# (sources recorded in apps/web/src/content/trips/<slug>.ts)
apps/web/public/trips/*/letter/
apps/web/public/trips/*/a4/
# single-document PDFs (Review sample, field-trip packs, conference guide):
# not committed either; production serves every document from S3 through
# /open (four-product site §6). publish_baseline_report.py, sync:trip-pdfs
# and the Wexcombe builder's --web-dir write them here for local opens.
apps/web/public/docs/*.pdf
